@startuml context-generation-prompt-activity-diagram
!theme plain
title Context Generation for Control System Analysis - Prompt Activity Workflow\nFirst Phase of Spec2Control - Preparing Context for FBD Generation

start

:Input: Control Narrative\n(User-provided control requirements);
note right
  Contains:
  - Control narrative description
  - Process requirements
  - Control objectives
  - System specifications
end note

:Execute Prompt 1\n**contextgen1-sensors**\nDetermine required sensor function\nblock types from control narrative;
note right
  Input: {{control-narrative}} ← autoContent
  Output: Sensor function block specifications
  Focus: ANALOG_IN, DIGITAL_IN, BOOL_IN
  **Include in Output: YES**
end note

:Execute Prompt 2\n**contextgen1-actuators**\nDetermine required actuator function\nblock types from control narrative;
note right
  Input: {{control-narrative}} ← autoContent
  Output: Actuator function block specifications
  Focus: Motors, valves with intelligent defaults
  **Include in Output: YES**
end note

:Execute Prompt 3\n**contextgen1-strategies**\nSelect most appropriate control strategy\nand provide function block specifications;
note right
  Input: {{control-narrative}} ← autoContent
  Output: 
  - Control strategy selection with probability
  - Complete function block specifications
  - Intended block connections
  Focus: Strategy evaluation and selection
  **Include in Output: YES**
end note

:Combine Context Generation Output\nfrom Steps 1, 2, 3;
note right
  All steps contribute to final context:
  - Sensor specifications
  - Actuator specifications  
  - Control strategy selection
  - Function block specifications
end note

:Context Generation Output:\n• Identified Sensor Types\n• Identified Actuator Types\n• Selected Control Strategy\n• BASIC_LIB Function Block Specifications\n• Intended Block-to-Block Connections;
note right
  This context feeds into the
  OpenPLC FBD Generation
  prompt chain as {{specification}}
end note

:Feed to OpenPLC FBD\nGeneration Prompt Chain;
note right
  Context + Control Narrative
  becomes {{specification}} input
  for the 10-step FBD generation
end note

stop

legend right
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | <- | Data Source |
  |= Phase |= Purpose |
  | Context Generation | Analyze narrative and identify components |
  | FBD Generation | Create complete function block diagram |
endlegend

@enduml